Scope

This license covers the material contained in this repository only: the analysis scripts and the
reference implementation of the trivial-baseline protocol (MIT), and the evaluation data, figures
and provenance records (CC BY 4.0).

No third-party model weights or datasets are redistributed here. The DeepPurpose, DrugBAN and
ConPLex weights, the ProtBert protein language model, and the ChEMBL, BindingDB and Davis data are
obtained from their own public sources; see README.md and conplex/README_conplex.md.
